  <div class="imagetext__text py-16">
    <p>BUILD is an annual Christian hackathon that brings together technologists from across Europe who are passionate about the intersection of faith and innovation.</p>
    <p>It's an energising weekend where Christian developers, designers, project managers, marketing professionals, and creative thinkers unite to collaborate on projects that matter. This isn't just about building technology—it's about discipleship. It's a space where our love for Jesus meets our technical skills, where we gather as a community to create technology that redeems, restores, and reflects God's kingdom.</p>
    <p>Over the weekend you might be working on a prototype to help an ministry explore an idea, building in a new feature to an existing project, or something completely different. Whatever you work on BUILD is your opportunity to work alongside fellow believers who share your conviction that technology can be a force for good in God's hands.</p>
    <p>In 2026 BUILD will be hosted by the FaithTech London community.</p>
